## Validation status

The repository includes synthetic validation assets and local Python checks. The project has not yet been executed against live Windows telemetry in an authorized lab environment, so all live detection testing remains explicitly marked as unvalidated.

---

This repository is intended for defensive security learning, detection engineering, and authorized technical validation. It is not a substitute for operational security tooling or a guarantee of detection coverage in any environment.
